zynthian_engine_plugind: plugin-hostd as a Zynthian engine (FreeMixer/plugin-hostd#124 spike), and the plugind strip
that links a chain's audio slots on plugin-hostd in order (docs/zynthian/chain-profile.md)

Against zynthian/zynthian-ui vangelis f46b0189b6163472db39aa607369f397ed23b65a (2026-10-19).
Apply: git -C zynthian-ui apply zynthian_engine_plugind.patch
Not sent to Zynthian; a spike's artefact for the plan in offer.md.

